lib/Langertha/Skeid/Protocol/Anthropic/Stream.pm delta(): the text block's start frame is emitted as event: content_block_start with data {type => 'content_block', ...} (line ~165), while the tool_use start (and every other frame) has matching event name and data type. The file's own comment in start() notes the official SDKs dispatch on the data type, so a text block start is a frame they do not recognise. No test asserts the data type of the text start. Found while working skeid #31, not fixed there (out of scope).
